title: Diagnose 'object not found' in R
---
flowchart LR
    A["Error: object<br/>not found"] --> B{"exists(name)<br/>TRUE?"}
    B -->|"No"| C{"In ls()<br/>with typo?"}
    B -->|"Yes"| D["Scope or<br/>dplyr NSE"]
    C -->|"Yes"| E["Cause 1:<br/>Typo / case"]
    C -->|"No"| F{"Package<br/>loaded?"}
    F -->|"No"| G["Cause 3:<br/>library()"]
    F -->|"Yes"| H["Causes 2, 4, 7:<br/>assign / order / restart"]
    D --> I["Causes 5, 6:<br/>scope / NSE"]
